  m_Name: Artefact_Scarab
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  baseData:
    id: Artefact_Scarab
    itemName: Winged Scarab Amulet
    itemDescription: 'This winged scarab consists of three pieces: an actual scarab
      beetle and two separately made wings. The wings are not those of a beetle,
      but those of a bird, as is apparent by their shape and the indication of individual
      feathers. Each piece features several small holes that were used to fasten
      the winged scarab to the wrappings of a mummy. Winged scarabs, meant to guarantee
      the rebirth of the deceased, were very popular funerary amulets.'
    itemIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e9d3de414e2f6174aaf09ec0720bdcbd, type: 3}
    exclude: 0
  stickyNoteTexts:
  - "Anyway, the latest pieces from Egypt just arrived...\n\nGood luck! \n-Ms. Maya"
  - "P.S I\u2019m so sorry about your mom\u2019s diagnosis yesterday... Glad to hear
    your aunt is there to help her out. \n\nIs there any way I can support you through
    this?"
  customGameplayBGM: 5
